{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02287","headline":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 三月 · 李贺","name":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 三月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东方风来满眼春，花城柳暗愁几人，复宫深殿竹风起。\n新翠舞襟静如水，光风转蕙百余里。\n暖雾驱云扑天地，军装宫妓扫蛾浅。\n摇摇锦旗夹城暖，曲水飘香去不归。\n梨花落尽成秋苑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}